  "title": "Build macOS and Windows releases with Qt 6.9.2",
  "description": "The Qt Company doesn't \"Long Term Support\" releases for free versions\nanymore. The last free 6.8 release was 6.8.3, which was back in March\n2025. Try building the Windows and macOS releases with 6.9.2, which\nshould address #20725.\n\n6.9 supports the same Windows and macOS versions as 6.8, and some\nLinux distributions have been using 6.9 for a while, so this shouldn't\nbe a problem.",
